{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17205","headline":"奉和张舍人阁老阁中直夜思闻雅琴因以书事通简僚友 · 权德舆","name":"奉和张舍人阁老阁中直夜思闻雅琴因以书事通简僚友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫垣宿清夜，蔼蔼复沈沈。\n圆月衡汉净，好风松涤深。\n轩窗韵虚籁，兰雪怀幽音。\n珠露销暑气，玉徽结遐心。\n盛才本殊伦，雅诰方在今。\n伫见舒彩翮，翻飞归凤林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17205.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17205","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}